From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shi Jiayang <shi05275@163.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: dsa: yt92xx: complete YT9224 switch support

Port the complete YT9224 switch implementation to Linux 6.18, including
the separate tagger, SerDes and eFuse setup, phylink PCS integration and
fixed CPU-port recovery.

Signed-off-by: Kyle Switch <kyle.switch@motor-comm.com>
Signed-off-by: Shi Jiayang <shi05275@163.com>
---
